Key SOC Takeaways

Detection is only the first step

Generating an alert is not the same as completing an investigation.

Context matters

The same scan can be:
	*	Authorized security testing
	*	Vulnerability scanning
	*	Malicious reconnaissance

The analyst needs additional context.

Network visibility matters

If an IDS cannot see the traffic, it cannot detect it.

Rules matter

The detection capability depends heavily on the configured rules.

Logs matter

The alert needs supporting event data for investigation.

Reconnaissance matters

Port scanning can provide early visibility into activity occurring against a network.

